& [Problem]
  + complete lifecycle ownership gives excellent proof locality but repeated multi-megabyte tool arguments waste transport and attention budget

& [Selection]
  + a pure immutable content-addressed registry proves the identity and replay rules before any mutable MCP state is introduced

& [Honesty]
  + retaining the complete request prevents the false claim that a digest recreates omitted meaning
  + regenerating validation responses avoids stale cached semantic conclusions

& [Security]
  + whole-registry replay exact handle equality finite resource bounds and functional successor construction prevent silent overwrite alias and partial mutation

& [Deferred]
  + mutable process custody persistence authorization eviction recovery and host installation require separate specifications
